<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49923" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ursa</span></b> , ae, f.
		ursus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>a she-bear.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 2,
				485</span></i>; <i><span class="en">13, 803</span></i>; <i><span class="en">13, 836</span></i>; 15, 379;
				<i><span class="en">id. F.
				2, 181</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. 6, 25,
			2</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Poet.</b>, <i>a bear</i>, in gen.,
				<i><span class="en">Verg.
				A. 5, 37</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 12, 319</span></i>; <i><span class="en">14,
			255</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>: Ursa, as <i>a
				constellation</i>, either Ursa Major, <i>the
				Greater Bear</i>, or Ursa Minor, <i>the Lesser
				Bear</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. H. 18</span></i> (17), 152; <i><span class="en">id. Tr. 1,
				4, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">3, 11, 8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">5, 3, 7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Val. Fl. 4,
				724</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Suet. Aug. 80</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Latin Dictionary</u>
        </u> (Charlton T. Lewis, Charles Short, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1879) </div>
</div>